   "source": [
    "# LFP Coherence Analysis – All Subjects (d0 vs d7)\n",
    "This notebook loads aligned LFP collections for all subjects and visualizes coherence \n",
    "between brain regions (mPFC, MD, NAc, BLA, vHPC) across time and frequency.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "6c579cbf-8de3-4599-9004-06a6a31dc38b",
